    "title": "Front Office Manager - Goa Tourism - Work From Home Available",
    "description": "Goa Tourism has an exciting opening for a Front Office Manager at our Kolkata office. Join a company that values innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning.\n\nAbout Goa Tourism:\nGoa Tourism is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Coordinate with travel agents and OTAs for occupancy optimization\n• Prepare daily operating reports and present to management\n• Ensure compliance with FSSAI, health, and safety regulations\n• Monitor F&B service quality and maintain hygiene standards\n• Deliver exceptional guest experiences in line with brand standards\n• Develop and maintain relationships with corporate clients\n• Handle guest complaints and resolve issues promptly\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• CA / CMA / CFA certification\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Tour Planning\n• Proficiency in Front Office\n• Proficiency in Barista Skills\n• Proficiency in Hotel Management\n• Proficiency in HACCP\n• Proficiency in Crisis Management\n• Proficiency in Opera PMS\n• Proficiency in Food Safety\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Flexible working hours\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Referral bonus program\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Kolkata, West Bengal, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Goa Tourism!",
